      "process_md": "**Step 1:** Visit the [Official Website](https://mppanchayatdarpan.gov.in/Default.aspx) of &quot;Panchayat Darpan 2.0&quot; by the Panchayat &amp; Rural Development Department.\n**Step 2:** Under &quot;Online Services&quot; click &quot;[Water Connection Application](https://mppanchayatdarpan.gov.in/Public/Online_Services/TapConnectionMgmt/Pages/Application_For_New_Tap_Connection.aspx?1)&quot;.\n**Step 3:** In the form, fill in all the mandatory fields and upload all the mandatory documents in the specified format and size.\n**Step 4:** Carefully review all the information provided. Make any necessary corrections. Click &quot;Submit Application&quot;. Note the Application Number for future reference.\n<br>\n\n**Post-Application Processes**\n**Step 1:** After examining the Registered application by the Gram Panchayat, notice will be issued to the applicant (if it is found correct).\n**Step 2:** As per the rules, the prescribed fee will have to be deposited before the due date.\n**Step 3:** After depositing the prescribed fee, the Connection Permission will be issued by the Gram Panchayat.\n<br>\n\n**Track Application Status**\nYou can check your application status &#39;[here](https://mppanchayatdarpan.gov.in/Public/Online_Services/TapConnectionMgmt/Pages/TapApplication_Status.aspx?2)&#39; by providing your Application Number and Mobile Number.\n"
    }
